msgid ""
"For goods bought by consumers, the seller is liable for any lack of conformity\n"
"                        which exists at the time of delivery and becomes apparent within two years.\n"
"                        Below you can find the official notice of the European Union, a short summary\n"
"                        of your rights and how to report a problem."
msgstr "Għall-oġġetti mixtrija mill-konsumaturi, il-bejjiegħ huwa responsabbli għal kwalunkwe nuqqas ta' konformità li jeżisti fiż-żmien tal-kunsinna u jidher fi żmien sentejn. Hawn taħt issib in-notifika uffiċjali tal-Unjoni Ewropea, qosor tad-drittijiet tiegħek u kif tirrapporta problema."

